                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I bought this game years ago, expecting Early Access to be temporary. Nearly SIX YEARS later, we’ve had only a handful of updates, and it’s still an embarrassing, buggy mess. No factions, no mounts, countless missing features—and barely any sign the developers care anymore.\n\nI’ve invested a lot of time in this game, and I’m bitterly disappointed. At this point, I doubt it will ever leave Early Access. SIX YEARS. Let that sink in.\n\nDo not buy it. This game feels dead.",
